    description: Some("You are the last starfighter of the planet Yarthae, holding off the Sphyzygies and their bio-droid Bobo. Bobo hovers overhead dropping bombs while four squares converge on a point below — a Sphyzygie materialises there, and touching one as it appears costs a life. Shoot them down before the next wave brings more at once."),
